{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":16452,\"title\":\"The Comedians of Comedy\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The Comedians of Comedy is an occasional stand-up comedy tour featuring Patton Oswalt, Zach Galifianakis, Brian Posehn and Maria Bamford that was documented in a 2005 film and 2005 Comedy Central television series of the same name, both directed by Michael Blieden.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z2iX8rxrFL3HAr8dWTbISJXZqM4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":45,\"year\":2005,\"runtime\":103,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Michael Blieden\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":91610,\"name\":\"Michael Blieden\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9S7TuVdXFZ5chVpu0WvVwUnloKy.jpg\"},{\"id\":10872,\"name\":\"Patton Oswalt\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ljQvjbPmcIAl205Lb2Mu4CW8WO7.jpg\"},{\"id\":20405,\"name\":\"Brian Posehn\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kg93LNpDQaRoosR4gVt7SsA3oL1.jpg\"},{\"id\":60278,\"name\":\"Maria Bamford\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7nhgW2aGeSEL9aN3ThhM8KXwzmh.jpg\"},{\"id\":58225,\"name\":\"Zach Galifianakis\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qsDfoUlRnXHUiqZeBPWHzmgmKGX.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":339927,\"title\":\"Kevin Hart: What Now?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lFg4tx0jAYkgrcm1bPBlM0FbQvH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d4pIsjOiPz8CUhkBCXFJVxSwNDY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Comedian Kevin Hart performs in front of a crowd of 50,000 people at Philadelphia's outdoor venue, Lincoln Financial Field.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13643,\"title\":\"George Carlin: It's Bad for Ya!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m9fIvowFHpVjGn5OzFKudp2XJLD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/629NplPGq1rYIFu6YhR6ri9jxEr.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It's Bad For Ya, Carlin's Emmy nominated 14th and final HBO special from March of 2008 features Carlin's noted irreverent and unapologetic observations on topics ranging from death, religion, bureaucracy, patriotism, overprotected children and big business to the pungent examinations of modern language and the decrepit state of the American culture.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":367735,\"title\":\"John Mulaney: The Comeback Kid\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pzM9t33T2YUA7vaCb2GxaDrlTW1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8iTGzNjDAFsn2zZr6sdJ79GLp5K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Armed with boyish charm and a sharp wit, the former \\\"SNL\\\" writer offers sly takes on marriage, his beef with babies and the time he met Bill Clinton.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":593489,\"title\":\"Anthony Jeselnik: Fire in the Maternity Ward\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/10EkzjVA0AWUArKnE53Nzf2pigj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rdaHUEeRSKeeL7tHc7Ry6oV0wif.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Forging his own comedic boundaries, Anthony Jeselnik revels in getting away with saying things others can't in this stand-up special shot in New York.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":613999,\"title\":\"Aziz Ansari: Right Now\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5vaYOkQ3MxOnxQLeKUNXiAfZVHb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2QyZSGSGIGqeODxBc2ssltu4ldj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a comedy special directed by Spike Jonze, Aziz Ansari shares deep personal insights and hilarious takes on wokeness, family and the social climate.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":161803,\"title\":\"CM101MMXI Fundamentals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nwmoYBOPJ2tLthK4z8rgfnHLu5D.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kQKJCku7vhz9Wce2PFm6ehWcBPh.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The funny little details of everyday life,  simple things that make us laugh.  An unforgettable performance from Cem Yilmaz.  Yilmaz captures the audience with his hilarious stories about relationships, humankind's struggle with the technology and professional life. Yilmaz proves us that a food delivery or even a funeral might be amusing when considered correctly.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22719,\"title\":\"Rune Klan: Går large\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gtle9Gum5RbdbRZT8HCJ6mwIHJt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDWnuCS8epGurHnTWHauJnFj1EF.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rune is not a fan of traditional classic magic shows where you wear a tuxedo, top hat and take yourself very seriously. Paradoxically, Rune has been heavily inspired by the big Las Vegas shows with big props, but that's where the party stops... It's still Rune Klan. The show is called “Rune Klan Goes Large” and that's exactly what he does - magnifies it all up! Rune toured with “Going Large” in 2007.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1061543,\"title\":\"Waly Dia : Ensemble ou rien\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l8PUsV2sAmZ3QInaXUFtGra8sQe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d8Sg4p1SbVu0JasZnqCBDSLZ0xZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1255883,\"title\":\"Alex Edelman: Just for Us\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kUFBY1vF4sCHVTv1Oy9s23269Or.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x7FvGNMA451hCIGTS23x98midnc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the wake of a string of anti-Semitic threats pointed in his direction online, Edelman decides to go straight to the source; specifically, Queens, where he covertly attends a meeting of White Nationalists and comes face-to-face with the people behind the keyboards.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":494368,\"title\":\"Dave Chappelle: The Bird Revelation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3dLJ4kSwnMGlHlR6AxwWqTsKJFs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dgWmfJvJrg8dwFQCjcFcPWxBUxh.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Comedy juggernaut Dave Chappelle's fourth Netflix Special, taped on November 20th, 2017 at Los Angeles' Comedy Store.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23270,\"title\":\"Russell Howard: Live\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2vaUS1n9AKoH0aiodvMu4GGmlis.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Russell has been busy cementing his place as one of the hottest properties in comedy with his BBC6 Music show every Sunday, loads of Mock The Week and Never Mind The Buzzcocks on BBC2, Would I Lie To You? and Live At The Apollo on BBC1, Law of the Playground on Channel 4 and Tough Gig, The Brits and The British Comedy Awards on ITV! But it is on stage where Russell really storms it.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1666433,\"title\":\"Trevor Noah: Joy in the Trenches\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nGbo6kZLHwcyBJOgr5b36OvBPPe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vSTlbow1yx2L85EEUhFiJOMo4LY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From unexpected social media beef to a therapist's truth bomb, Trevor Noah turns chaos into comedy in this hilariously sharp, playful stand-up set.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"xA8TZ5jomzU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"mPOfzpKmn6w\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"F3Qv4XYRR2E\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}